Algorithm:

Step 1: Start
Step 2: Initialize empty board
Step 3: Display board
Step 4: Accept human move
Step 5: Check for win
Step 6: Apply AI rules (win, block, center, corner, side)
Step 7: Make AI move
Step 8: Check for win or draw
Step 9: Repeat until game ends
Step 10: Stop



